{"info":{"name":"BMA-79 Identity Verification (S15)","description":"BMA-79 S15 본인인증 API 검증 컬렉션 (S15 사양서 v1.4, BMA-19 안건3 미성년자 가입 불가).\n\n상태 → 미인증 매칭 진입 차단(VERIFY_001) → 요청(거래 ID) → 확인(스텁 인증사, 성인) → 재인증 없이 매칭 진입 → 미성년자 거부·계정 롤백(VERIFY_003) → 생일 당일 경계 → 중복 CI(VERIFY_004) → 거래 ID 오류/검증 실패 순서로 검증한다.\nRunner 로 위에서부터 순서대로 실행한다. 인증사는 스텁(app.verification.identity.provider=stub)이며 providerPayload.result 에 넣은 값이 인증 결과로 쓰인다. 요청 만료(10분)는 DB 로 재현한다 — backend/scripts/verify-identity.sh 참고.","schema":"https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"},"item":[{"name":"1. A(남) 가입","event":[{"listen":"prerequest","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["// 매 실행마다 새 계정을 쓴다. 미성년자 생년월일은 실행 시점 기준 만 18세로 계산한다.","const t = Date.now(); const y = new Date().getFullYear();","for (const n of [\"A\",\"B\",\"C\",\"D\"]) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"email\"+n, \"identity-\"+n.toLowerCase()+\"-\"+t+\"@bma.test\"); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"nick\"+n, \"인증\"+n+(t % 10000)); }","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"minorBirth\", (y-18)+\"-05-05\");","const mm = String(new Date().getMonth()+1).padStart(2,\"0\"), dd = String(new Date().getDate()).padStart(2,\"0\");","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"birthdayToday19\", (y-19)+\"-\"+mm+\"-\"+dd);"]}},{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userA\", pm.response.json().data.userId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/signup","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","signup"]}}},{"name":"1. A(남) 로그인","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenA\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshA\", pm.response.json().data.refreshToken);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"email\":\"{{emailA}}\",\"password\":\"{{password}}\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","auth","login"]}}},{"name":"1. A(남) 프로필","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]}}],"request":{"method":"PUT","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"nickname\":\"{{nickA}}\",\"birthDate\":\"1995-05-05\",\"genderCode\":\"M\",\"regionCode\":\"SEOUL_GANGNAM\"}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/profile","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me","profile"]}}},{"name":"2. 상태 - 미인증","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"verified false, matchingAllowed false, lastAttemptStatus null\", () => { pm.expect(d.verified).to.eql(false); pm.expect(d.matchingAllowed).to.eql(false); pm.expect(d).to.have.property(\"lastAttemptStatus\", null); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/identity/status","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","identity","status"]}}},{"name":"3. 내 정보 - identityVerified false","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"identityVerified false\", () => pm.expect(d.identityVerified).to.eql(false));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me"]}}},{"name":"4. 미인증 매칭 진입 → 403 VERIFY_001 (S4 → S15 관문)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 403 VERIFY_001\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(403); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"VERIFY_001\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/matching/queue","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","matching","queue"]}}},{"name":"5. 인증 요청 (S15-04) → 거래 ID·stub·SDK 파라미터·만료","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.collectionVariables.set(\"txA\", d.transactionId); pm.test(\"transactionId, provider stub, sdkToken, expiresAt\", () => { pm.expect(d.transactionId).to.be.a(\"string\"); pm.expect(d.provider).to.eql(\"stub\"); pm.expect(d.sdkParams).to.have.property(\"sdkToken\"); pm.expect(d.expiresAt).to.be.a(\"string\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/identity/request","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","identity","request"]}}},{"name":"6. 상태 - lastAttemptStatus REQUESTED","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"REQUESTED\", () => pm.expect(d.lastAttemptStatus).to.eql(\"REQUESTED\"));"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/identity/status","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","identity","status"]}}},{"name":"7. 재요청 → 새 거래 ID","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"새 ID\", () => pm.expect(d.transactionId).to.not.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"txA\"))); pm.collectionVariables.set(\"txA2\", d.transactionId);"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/identity/request","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","identity","request"]}}},{"name":"8. 옛 거래 ID 로 확인 → 409 VERIFY_006 (만료)","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 409 VERIFY_006\", () => { pm.response.to.have.status(409); pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(\"VERIFY_006\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"transactionId\":\"{{txA}}\",\"providerPayload\":{\"result\":{\"name\":\"홍길동\",\"birthDate\":\"1995-05-05\",\"genderCode\":\"M\",\"phoneNumber\":\"01011112222\"}}}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/identity/confirm","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","identity","confirm"]}}},{"name":"9. 확인 (성인 1995-05-05) → VERIFIED","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"VERIFIED, adult, matchingAllowed, stub\", () => { pm.expect(d.status).to.eql(\"VERIFIED\"); pm.expect(d.adult).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.matchingAllowed).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.provider).to.eql(\"stub\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"POST","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"body":{"mode":"raw","raw":"{\"transactionId\":\"{{txA2}}\",\"providerPayload\":{\"result\":{\"name\":\"홍길동\",\"birthDate\":\"1995-05-05\",\"genderCode\":\"M\",\"phoneNumber\":\"01011112222\"}}}"},"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/identity/confirm","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","identity","confirm"]}}},{"name":"10. 상태 - verified true","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"verified, verifiedAt, VERIFIED\", () => { pm.expect(d.verified).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.verifiedAt).to.be.a(\"string\"); pm.expect(d.lastAttemptStatus).to.eql(\"VERIFIED\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verification/identity/status","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","verification","identity","status"]}}},{"name":"11. 내 정보 - identityVerified true","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"identityVerified true, identityVerifiedAt\", () => { pm.expect(d.identityVerified).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.identityVerifiedAt).to.be.a(\"string\"); });"]}}],"request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"},{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{tokenA}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["api","v1","users","me"]}}},{"name":"12. AC: 재인증 없이 매칭 진입 → 200 WAITING","event":[{"listen":"test","script":{"type":"text/javascript","exec":["pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));","const d = pm.response.json().data;","pm.test(\"WAITING\", () => pm.expect(d.status).to.eql(\"WAITING\"));"]}}],"req